{{Iron Guide Links}}

[[Prayer]] is a slower skill to train for ironmen due to having to obtain bones themselves. Ideally, it is best to use every bone on an [[experience]] boosting altar, such as the [[Chaos Temple (hut)|Chaos Altar]], [[Ectofuntus]], [[Libation bowl]], or with high [[Construction]], a [[gilded altar]] in the [[chapel]] of your [[player-owned house]]. A [[bone crusher]] or [[ash sanctifier]] can be used for passive experience while training when the bones dropped are not worth picking up.

Early Prayer goals include level 43 for {{plink|Protect from Magic}}, {{plink|Protect from Missiles}} and {{plink|Protect from Melee}}, and level 45 for all stat-boosting Prayers up to {{plink|Mystic Might}}.

Later goals include level 70 for {{plink|Piety}}, and level 85 for the [[Elite Desert Diary]].

==Early training: Quests==
{{Main|Quest experience rewards#Prayer}}
Early levels can be skipped by completing [[quest]]s that reward Prayer [[experience]]. Completing all of the following quests will reward enough experience for 42 Prayer:

* [[The Restless Ghost]] rewards 1,125 Prayer experience.
* [[Priest in Peril]] rewards 1,406 Prayer experience.
* [[Holy Grail]] requires {{SCP|Attack|20}} and [[Merlin's Crystal]] and rewards 11,000 Prayer experience for very low requirements.
* [[Recruitment Drive]] requires [[Druidic Ritual]] and [[Black Knights' Fortress]], rewards 1,000.5 Prayer experience.
* [[Rag and Bone Man I]] rewards 500 Prayer experience.
* [[Ghosts Ahoy]] requires {{SCP|Agility|25}}, {{SCP|Cooking|20}}, Priest in Peril, and The Restless Ghost, rewards 2,400 Prayer experience.
* [[Making History]] requires Priest in Peril and partial completion of The Restless Ghost, rewards 1,000 Prayer experience.
* [[Spirits of the Elid]] requires {{SCP|Magic|33}}, {{SCP|Ranged|37}}, {{SCP|Mining|37}}, {{SCP|Thieving|37}}, rewards 8,000 Prayer experience.
* [[Another Slice of H.A.M.|Another Slice of H.A.M]] requires {{SCP|Attack|15}}, {{SCP|Prayer|25}}, rewards 3,000 Prayer experience.
* [[His Faithful Servants]] rewards 20,000 Prayer experience. While it has no hard requirements other than [[Priest in Peril]], protection prayers are highly recommended.

